                   brary will be _s_n_m_p___$_{_M_O_D_}_._s_o.  There must exist a file
                   _$_{_M_O_D_}___t_r_e_e_._d_e_f for compilation with gensnmptree(1) which
                   contains the definition of the MIB tree implemented by the
